@API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7006
@AdminToken = your_admin_access_token_here
@UserToken = your_user_access_token_here
@RefreshToken = your_refresh_token_here

### ============================================================
### AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================

### 1. Register a new user (Automatically assigned "User" role)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "johndoe",
  "email": "johndoe@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "John Doe"
}

### 2. Login as Default Admin (Seeded on startup: admin@cleanarch.com / Admin123!)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrUserName": "admin@cleanarch.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### 3. Login as Default User (Seeded on startup: user@cleanarch.com / User123!)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrUserName": "user@cleanarch.com",
  "password": "User123!"
}

### 4. Get Current User profile and roles
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Refresh Token (Rotates access token and refresh token)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accessToken": "{{UserToken}}",
  "refreshToken": "{{RefreshToken}}"
}

### 6. Logout (Revoke refresh token)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{RefreshToken}}"
}

### ============================================================
### ADMIN SYSTEM MANAGEMENT (Requires "Admin" Role)
### ============================================================

### 7. Admin: Get all users with roles (System Management)
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Admin: Get system statistics overview
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/system-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. Admin: Assign Role to a User
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/roles/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "target-user-id-here",
  "role": "Admin"
}

### ============================================================
### PROJECT ENDPOINTS (Secured with [Authorize])
### ============================================================

### 10. Get all projects
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. User: Create a new project (Becomes owner of this project)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "User's Project",
  "description": "Project owned and managed by standard user"
}

### 12. User: Modify Own Project (Allowed for owner or Admin)
PUT {{API_HostAddress}}/api/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "User's Project (Updated)",
  "description": "Updated project description"
}

### 13. User: Delete Own Project (Allowed for owner or Admin)
DELETE {{API_HostAddress}}/api/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}

### ============================================================
### TASK ENDPOINTS (Secured with [Authorize])
### ============================================================

### 14. User: Create Task in Own Project (Allowed)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Design Database Schema",
  "description": "Configure entity relationships and constraints in AppDbContext",
  "priority": "High",
  "status": "Todo",
  "projectId": 1
}

### 15. User: Attempt to Create Task in Another User's Project (Returns 403 Forbidden)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unauthorized Task",
  "description": "Should be blocked because user doesn't own project 99",
  "priority": "Medium",
  "status": "Todo",
  "projectId": 99
}

### 16. User: Modify Own Task (Allowed)
PUT {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Task Title",
  "description": "Updated details",
  "priority": "High",
  "status": "InProgress",
  "projectId": 1
}

### 17. User: Update Task Status (Todo -> InProgress)
PATCH {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InProgress"
}

### 18. Admin: Can modify any task across the system
PUT {{API_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Admin Modified Task",
  "description": "System admin override",
  "priority": "High",
  "status": "Completed",
  "projectId": 1
}

### ============================================================
### COMMENT ENDPOINTS (Secured with [Authorize])
### ============================================================

### 19. User: Add Comment to a Task
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": 1,
  "content": "Reviewed the workflow and authorization requirements."
}

### 20. User: Delete Own Comment (Allowed for owner or Admin)
DELETE {{API_HostAddress}}/api/comments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}
